{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:24:36Z","created_by_operation":"op_6d2da894b45d49ea8b7db90d982c13e6","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_676de505113dc5cf97e52690cb4429cf449013796825a64325754d909d618429","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=relevance","setting":"swe-agent/swe-rex@5c995c365dfb snapshot acc27ffd0a3eab30","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_6aaf21161ab93bd645687978a8e5658aae4d107131a949a48d3ecef332a301d2","slc_73f2787b2f06b82c333a90358e22417baddf86511ab3e62fd27b51d1a41fccc0","slc_a4f865c367adadc12902f2a920ef05c64c1f49e0cde92c9d001d52ad5f6eaa9b","slc_a7cf5f3385889464cb73518f00083174cb42e9bd7c333579e94c29dbc42ef54e"],"source_ids":["src_472b7f295443531c80d668db702ff376","src_536fb109f90f57a492782f454f8df7e1"],"text":"SWE-ReX originated from the SWE-agent and SWE-agent enigma projects and aims to disentangle agent logic from infrastructure concerns.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:24:36Z","updated_by_operation":"op_6d2da894b45d49ea8b7db90d982c13e6"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:24:36Z","created_by_operation":"op_6d2da894b45d49ea8b7db90d982c13e6","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_6ceea63df734e3e24a0c1b3ffedd73ccac359a5b4f3a6a546650c7bfbf9115f8","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=components","setting":"swe-agent/swe-rex@5c995c365dfb snapshot acc27ffd0a3eab30","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_c3e9fe7454884fed38bfedaf8074eb1beab3ca7a670de14e83145963060c2539","slc_dc8843b8121f415dfb72f35ffa6754a56cd9114a386193fe6dfbff49e75a3ffa","slc_e7d5adfc81a1b6cdc791e4a9fc5bb7c9d05616e6282a81d4e8ffb441c57506e4"],"source_ids":["src_9c1e6cbb99875771b62cc985c742253c"],"text":"Deployment configuration objects such as DockerDeploymentConfig configure deployments; e.g. a config is created with an image name and get_deployment() returns the deployment.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:24:36Z","updated_by_operation":"op_6d2da894b45d49ea8b7db90d982c13e6"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:24:36Z","created_by_operation":"op_6d2da894b45d49ea8b7db90d982c13e6","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_97e3728d64d8e71b86e80ee6f665c875bb3f1e469962092042b26f1bef08bdb4","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=design-choices","setting":"swe-agent/swe-rex@5c995c365dfb snapshot acc27ffd0a3eab30","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_0ccb497efe1adb33c589e9fd05d47cb7c6ecf18e69bde396bf9a535afa8a2f05","slc_fe17cf9db1026d14655dd63fbe1fd107f0701be34dc959137462ae4084c92ea1"],"source_ids":["src_472b7f295443531c80d668db702ff376","src_536fb109f90f57a492782f454f8df7e1"],"text":"Agent code stays the same regardless of whether commands run locally, in Docker containers, on AWS remote machines, Modal, or other backends.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:24:36Z","updated_by_operation":"op_6d2da894b45d49ea8b7db90d982c13e6"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:24:36Z","created_by_operation":"op_6d2da894b45d49ea8b7db90d982c13e6","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.5,"id":"clm_d2c20d571421fb60071f751de608eb7a21801a80ff28e944bb806d40a4832008","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=inference; facet=design-choices","setting":"swe-agent/swe-rex@5c995c365dfb snapshot acc27ffd0a3eab30","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_4496ea132da538356675210956e8bbedd65560e455122b53943c09ce00a3cad0"],"source_ids":["src_17214af7ae105af48f573b3cafa9284d"],"text":"Because LocalRuntime can be used directly when code runs locally or in a sandboxed environment, the framework appears to support fully local usage without a remote deployment.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:24:36Z","updated_by_operation":"op_6d2da894b45d49ea8b7db90d982c13e6"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:24:36Z","created_by_operation":"op_6d2da894b45d49ea8b7db90d982c13e6","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_fca8982ef3065dd80bfa6153eda29e1ffd6dd3c6ddcb626f0e2906a25e96411c","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"swe-agent/swe-rex@5c995c365dfb snapshot acc27ffd0a3eab30","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_4d6fbba9d1ed3a29a1e1188b28d950c9800027bfe528246d091e999bb5a81efd"],"source_ids":["src_17214af7ae105af48f573b3cafa9284d"],"text":"The Runtime class provides file read/write methods, an execute method for arbitrary commands, and a run_in_session method to run commands in an existing shell or interactive session.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:24:36Z","updated_by_operation":"op_6d2da894b45d49ea8b7db90d982c13e6"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:24:36Z","created_by_operation":"op_6d2da894b45d49ea8b7db90d982c13e6","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_fe5a5f4c8a1acaddc566865581f95a952cc0ee40235826056be2a4121408208a","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=components","setting":"swe-agent/swe-rex@5c995c365dfb snapshot acc27ffd0a3eab30","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_4496ea132da538356675210956e8bbedd65560e455122b53943c09ce00a3cad0"],"source_ids":["src_17214af7ae105af48f573b3cafa9284d"],"text":"A FastAPI server inside the container forwards requests from RemoteRuntime to LocalRuntime, which actually executes commands; the two classes share the same interface, are interchangeable, and exceptions from LocalRuntime are transferred transparently.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:24:36Z","updated_by_operation":"op_6d2da894b45d49ea8b7db90d982c13e6"}
